
# Simple Recipes

## Project Description
Simple Recipes is a basic HTML and CSS website that shares
easy and delicious recipes for everyday cooking.

## Features
- Home page with a welcome section
- Navigation menu
- Three recipe cards
- Ingredients and cooking instructions
- Additional About section
- Contact section
- Responsive design for mobile and desktop screens

## Technologies Used
- HTML5
- CSS3

## What I Learned
Through this project, I practiced creating web page structures
with HTML and styling them with CSS. I also learned about
navigation links, images, CSS Grid, hover effects, and
responsive web design.

## How to Run
1. Download or clone this repository.
2. Open the Simple-Recipes folder.
3. Open index.html in a web browser.

